Modification: adapted as eclipse health module — a thin subprocess wrapper around
`jrnl --export json` plus a JSON parser/search layer. No upstream source or
assets are bundled in this repository. Upstream license text is not bundled
here; see the URL above.

The module invokes upstream as a separate process and exchanges JSON-RPC 2.0 on
stdio, so GPL code is not statically linked into the core. This adapter layer is
licensed GPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE).

